Hi,

More a R-Sig-Geo question but I'm sure there is connection with the rgrass7
package.
You have some errors because the argument of the image function are not the
right one.
I think you should take a look at the help of the
image.SpatialPixelsDataFrame function (?image.SpatialPixelsDataFrame)

You will see that something along these lines should work

image(year_aegypti, "repro.rate", col = topo.colors(20))
spplot(year_aegypti, "repro.rate")

A final tips when using a Spatial*DataFrame object, it's better to access
directly the column like this 'year_aegypti$repro.rate' instead of
'year_aegypti at data$repro.rate'

Hope it helps



